# UVAI Learning Loop - Activity Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> VideoIngestion
    VideoIngestion --> EventExtraction: Gemini/Veo Analysis
    EventExtraction --> RAGGrounding: Metadata & Transcripts
    RAGGrounding --> AgentDispatch: Task Generation
    
    state "Execution & Monitoring" as Execution {
        AgentDispatch --> CodeGeneration
        CodeGeneration --> ExecutionTest
        ExecutionTest --> Deployment
    }
    
    Deployment --> FeedbackCollection: Performance Logs / User Feedback
    
    state "Learning Loop" as LearningLoop {
        FeedbackCollection --> Analysis: Analyze Failures/Successes
        Analysis --> SkillRefinement: Update Skill Adapters
        SkillRefinement --> RAGUpdate: Augment Knowledge Base
    }
    
    RAGUpdate --> AgentDispatch: Improved Context for Next Run
    FeedbackCollection --> [*]: Complete
```
